      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，祝您生日快樂！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C795D60A8751F65E55FEB6A02FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今天是個特別的日子！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n雖然早了一天，\n不過，祝您生日快樂！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA5929662F500B72795225768465E55B50FF0100100001BE01000A96D6713665E94E864E005929FF0C000A4E0D904EFF0C795D60A8751F65E55FEB6A02FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望接下來這一年\n您每天都能過得精彩！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B63A54E0B4F8690194E005E74000A60A86BCF592990FD80FD904E5F977CBE5F69FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先來幫寶可夢回復活力吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51484F865E6B5BF653EF592256DE5FA96D3B529B5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢的體力……\n也就是HP變少了的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請積極地利用這裡進行回復吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n或者我建議您也可以\n在這裡買好傷藥，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以備不時之需。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那麼，請好好加油吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大家都回復活力囉！",
